fixed.\",\n      \"observed\": \"y=\\\\left(\\\\frac{C}{2} + \\\\frac{x^{2}}{2} + \\\\frac{x}{2}\\\\right)^{2} -> y=\\\\left(\\\\frac{C}{2} + \\\\frac{x^{2}}{2} + x\\\\right)^{2}; printed solution final rows match both keys. Native grader accepts the correct choice and rejects every alternative in each member. Actual UI renders both members. Answer changes; interval-copy action nevertheless stays successful in the root families.\",\n      \"status\": \"passed\",\n      \"justification\": \"23d66cc8-8e5a-5a33-a7a1-c43f5facdcbc / e-10833 and 56fc1c96-3599-5022-8d83-60d4188ccf07 / tutorial 6767 make signed h(x) relevant, while random seed and choice ordering do not affect the ODE solution.\",\n      \"sample_refs\": [\n        \"pairs.json\",\n        \"counterfactual-results.json\",\n        \"grader-input.json\",\n        \"grader-report.json\",\n        \"render-all/rendering.json\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"relevant\",\n      \"change\": \"q-8304 a=1 to 2, same seed.\",\n      \"expected\": \"Reconsider printed ODE; update primitive, keyed answer and solution together. All other template structure is held fixed.\",\n      \"observed\": \"y=\\\\left(K + 3 \\\\sqrt{x}\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{2}{3}} -> y=\\\\left(K + 6 \\\\sqrt{x}\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{2}{3}}; printed solution final rows match both keys. Native grader accepts the correct choice and rejects every alternative in each member. Actual UI renders both members. Answer changes; interval-copy action nevertheless stays successful in the root families.\",\n      \"status\": \"passed\",\n      \"justification\": \"23d66cc8-8e5a-5a33-a7a1-c43f5facdcbc / e-10833 and 56fc1c96-3599-5022-8d83-60d4188ccf07 / tutorial 6767 make signed h(x) relevant, while random seed and choice ordering do not affect the ODE solution.\",\n      \"sample_refs\": [\n        \"pairs.json\",\n        \"counterfactual-results.json\",\n        \"grader-input.json\",\n        \"grader-report.json\",\n        \"render-all/rendering.j