elivery-fresh/accepted.json\",\n        \"pairs.json\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"delivery\": {\n    \"stages_examined\": [\n      \"generator parameter validation and absence of rejection/resampling for easy grid\",\n      \"requested difficulty\",\n      \"KP and question validation\",\n      \"normalization/stable identities\",\n      \"captured-inventory and within-batch deduplication\",\n      \"learner select() weighted-band/uniform-member logic; illustrative fresh-history scenarios\"\n    ],\n    \"sample_refs\": [\n      \"runtime.json\",\n      \"delivery-commands.json\",\n      \"delivery-batch/delivery.json\",\n      \"delivery-easy/delivery.json\",\n      \"delivery-moderate/delivery.json\",\n      \"delivery-hard/delivery.json\",\n      \"fresh-seed-delivery-command.json\",\n      \"coverage-results.json\",\n      \"learner-selection.json\"\n    ],\n    \"result\": \"Captured inventory basis 5369. Batch 5->5, grid 48->43, fresh seeds 16->13, moderate regression/leak input 28->22, hard 12->11. Interval shortcut remains perfect conditionally in affected survivors. Fresh-learner selection reproduction reaches affected moderate templates; weights/history can remove members but cannot cure their cue. No live policy/history was supplied, so exact future learner frequencies are not asserted.\"\n  },\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"No exhaustive audit of every coefficient at moderate/hard; tested source defaults, upper boundaries and targeted leak values.\",\n    \"No finite audit rules out all shortcuts.\",\n    \"The controlled grid deliberately holds the shuffle seed fixed; its all-fifth-position pattern is not an inherent generator finding. Ordinary-seed and exact-batch probes are reported separately.\",\n    \"Live inventory, numeric entity ordering, policy weights and learner histories may differ from captured assumptions. Selection code was examined; exact live selection was not available.\",\n    \"Affected inventory absence is verified for the six captured generated records only, which were reproduced completely; original source questions remain original.\"\n  ]\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
